  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 9th level, the cartomancer may expend an additional use of the tell fortune class feature when telling a mark's fortune in order to reroll a roll on <strong>Table: Tell Fortune Outcomes</strong>. Rerolls cannot themselves be rerolled, nor can natural rolls of '1', '13', and '20'. Starting at 19th level, the cartomancer can reroll natural rolls of '1', '13', and '20'.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/cartomancer#toc26\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
